      "title": "Too old to dangle movie review - Roger Ebert",
      "snippet": "The great failing of \"Spider-Man 3\" is that it failed to distract me from what a sap Peter Parker is. It lingers so long over the dopey romance between Peter and the long-suffering Mary Jane that I found myself asking the question: Could a whole movie about the relationship between these two twentysomethings be made?",
